/wiki/Devoured_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Devoured Eternal Debtor\">Devoured</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Voyeur_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Voyeur Eternal Debtor\">Voyeur</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Visionary_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Visionary Eternal Debtor\">Visionary</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Waltzing_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Waltzing Eternal Debtor\">Waltzing</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Unclean_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Unclean Eternal Debtor\">Unclean</a> eternal debtors</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Merregon\" title=\"Vengeful Merregon\">Vengeful Merregon</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Theologist_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Theologist Eternal Debtor\">Theologist</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Immortal_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Immortal Eternal Debtor\">Immortal</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Mocking_Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Mocking Eternal Debtor\">Mocking</a> eternal debtors</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060502\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.105 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.112 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3475/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 97074/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 35748/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 37/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1335852/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n131.31%  113.038     40 Template:Trim\n100.00%   86.085      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   86.085      1 -total\n 36.10%   31.079      3 Template:Creature\n 24.20%   20.832      3 Template:Creature/format\n 22.93%   19.736      3 Template:AttributeBlock\n 15.62%   13.450      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 11.62%   10.006      4 Template:Template_style\n 10.41%    8.964      5 Template:Icon_text\n  9.21%    7.924     18 Template:IfEmpty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved 